{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/469019-painted-corners","id":469019,"title":"Painted Corners","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-04T18:05:44-07:00","id":469019,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon4.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Painted Corners","content":"Hi there.<br /> <br /> My name is Pete Sears and I write a blogspot blog entitled \u201cPainted Corners\u201d<br /> One of the things that I enjoy doing with my roleplaying games is making the details of my characters world come alive. What I refer to as \u201cPainting the Corners in the World of Darkness\u201d<br /> <br /> BTW: You don\u2019t even have to play World of Darkness game to get some use out of this work. It will work for ANY modern day urban fantasy setting you might favor, with minimal re-tooling.<br /> <br /> This blog is a repository of people, places, widgets, legends, and bit of occult book text. So that you can make it look you\u2019ve done a TON of work tricking out your own personal World of Darkness. And I lean mostly on the side of mortals so that you can concentrate on whatever creatures you favor for your games. I also leave the mechanics of a particular thing up to you. A fairly crunchy antagonist for Vampire is likely to be hor\u2019s de combat in a Mage game. <br /> <br /> The point of this whole exercise is enrich the playing experience, keep my writing tools sharp, and hopefuly build a audience, so, if you like what you see, I\u2019d appreciate it if you\u2019d tell a friend. Thank you.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://painted-corners.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://painted-corners.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://painted-corners.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://painted-corners.blogspot.com/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5560-reverend-kinesys","name":"Reverend Kinesys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}